  <item>
    <title>箭厂电台18 吹啤酒、打礼炮、当场点钱送演员：东北夜场讲究的就是排面儿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67330ea6f373fe5d4daacf52</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67330ea6f373fe5d4daacf52</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Nov 2024 08:27:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>天气一冷，就想去东北转一转。</span></p><span></span><p><span>吃锅包肉、上冰雪大世界，又或者看看咱最新人文系列纪录片《东北不差事儿》（现已加入哔哩哔哩纪录片“泛纪实”原创栏目），从鲜活个体到东方魔幻，多角度描摹东北的旧事与新象。</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV11sS7YWENV/?spm_id_from=333.1387.0.0" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV11sS7YWENV/?spm_id_from=333.1387.0.0"><span>第一集《今夜斯卡拉》</span></a><span>现已放送。</span></p><span></span><p><span>众所周知，西方有疯马秀，而咱东北有自己的斯卡拉。它是斯卡拉演艺大舞台，或者说是剧院式夜总会。</span></p><span></span><p><span>尤其我们这回拍的哈尔滨斯卡拉，在改名SCALA SHOW HOUSE、搞灯光秀、创女团之前，是很多草根艺人逐梦演艺圈的第一站，比如小沈阳、李玉刚。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目就从这里出发，和拍摄团队聊一聊东北夜场文化的台前幕后故事，以及我们在东北的人情洞察。</span></p><span></span><p><span>演员在台上飙高音吹啤酒、观众在台下点钱送演员，刚去斯卡拉，我们被热烈的夜场气氛迷了眼。但是当我们进入这些演员的生活世界后，再看演出，却渐渐笑不出来了。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X2pwZy8zQkhPWFJnaWJBTGV5b1Y5c1hMMGdGeXltanRFS05FcGxWd0FCTjBjSWlhdmRlV1V5eThqV0RVU3AybG43d1JTYkNNaWJ3VmN1VktZVkR6WTdrcGppYnhPUVEvNjQwP3d4X2ZtdD1qcGVn"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X3BuZy8zQkhPWFJnaWJBTGV5b1Y5c1hMMGdGeXltanRFS05FcGw5TW9Pd1RJVjJGTXVjNWhGVkU4UHE3OEl5QmFvMmVpYXBTd2hYM3hMczZqTk9rS3JpYkhETDE0Zy82NDA_d3hfZm10PXBuZyZmcm9tPWFwcG1zZw=="></p><span></span><h2><span>本期来宾</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FivT242Cwh9MYs8WPBpe5rk0uZBP.png"></figure><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>本期主播</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FluBDepSxHQH3lvvJUynzYA8lV5R.png"></figure><span></span><h2><span>本期剧透</span></h2><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">00:06:51</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>啥是斯卡拉？小沈阳从这里走向全国</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X3BuZy8zQkhPWFJnaWJBTGV5b1Y5c1hMMGdGeXltanRFS05FcGxBR0IyUGZBeVBobzlsVFVDb2tSNHFMSWwxaWFiMTZWUzI0alhsRXRrNzFVeElaNDRtN3RNNHdBLzY0MD93eF9mbXQ9cG5nJmZyb209YXBwbXNn"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X3BuZy8zQkhPWFJnaWJBTGV5b1Y5c1hMMGdGeXltanRFS05FcGxrNmlhdUdENlNpYUdpYmxsbU1pY3lueVJlMFdyRFh5SUZ4cWljaWNYMndpYTNsRlI1V1k0eWlidmxBY3dRZy82NDA_d3hfZm10PXBuZyZmcm9tPWFwcG1zZw=="></p><span></span><p><em><span>小沈阳、春阳在斯卡拉表演《大话西游》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">00:10:34</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>我表演吹啤酒自残，就是为了给你面儿</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X3BuZy8zQkhPWFJnaWJBTGV5b1Y5c1hMMGdGeXltanRFS05FcGw3VWliUmJBNFdZQmpCSHhQc1RWa1dDOEc0dlE1TFBVdEU0Q2d6bmNpYjJnZHA4VFdHb0xiSXUzdy82NDA_d3hfZm10PXBuZyZmcm9tPWFwcG1zZw=="></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X3BuZy8zQkhPWFJnaWJBTGV5b1Y5c1hMMGdGeXltanRFS05FcGx0VGJ2bk9lSmRrbkRYaWNFVkpWZ05HQjdYa2tYcm4yeEppY1BpYmp5VUR4UkNCTTljeUpWUEZ3TUEvNjQwP3d4X2ZtdD1wbmcmZnJvbT1hcHBtc2c="><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1104">00:18:24</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>斯卡拉不止是一个看演出的地方，更是一个社交场</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">00:20:05</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>为什么要拍一个二代爆改的故事？</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">00:21:22</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>爆改后的节目单，以及咱拍的不是沈阳那家东方斯卡拉</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">00:25:30</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>姜鹏：哈尔滨斯卡拉创始人，50多岁依然在台上唱跳人气贼高</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1688">00:28:08</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>小黄飞：东北二人转女王</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X3BuZy8zQkhPWFJnaWJBTGV5b1Y5c1hMMGdGeXltanRFS05FcGw2NWljTlY0UDdpYnBqaG9hWmliaWJpYzZpYTU5Y09VZWFBNDRRV0pmWjlWQ2dwQWljbExGQlFjMGlhUHNlUS82NDA_d3hfZm10PXBuZyZmcm9tPWFwcG1zZw=="></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X3BuZy8zQkhPWFJnaWJBTGV5b1Y5c1hMMGdGeXltanRFS05FcGxwNG41UzVDdTV6bnY1dGNIclBVS3JmTDBLYUhpYzl4dHN5dmtvMU8zUkhWdU1ZQlFpY3B0akZnQS82NDA_d3hfZm10PXBuZyZmcm9tPWFwcG1zZw=="><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">00:32:25</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>每天重复同样的笑话，其实也会形成一种情绪劳损</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2432">00:40:32</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>东北人就是爱让人高兴：哪怕不确定自己能办妥也要先给你个情绪价值：“没问题，这事儿包我身上！”</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">00:42:40</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>东北i人改造史：小时候被爸妈抱着满街溜达，直到家里来人不再哭了为止</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">00:43:10</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>“怎么课文啥都背不住，小品台词能记这么清楚？”</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2716">00:45:16</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>“你抄一嘴东北话，就很难做那种忧郁帅哥了”</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2949">00:49:09</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>“这次算是今年最愉快的拍摄之一了😊”</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>本期提及</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小沈阳、春阳《大话西游》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV11sS7YWENV/?spm_id_from=333.1387.0.0&amp;vd_source=0a8a30e495e3cdaa7291f4e0d60c2599" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV11sS7YWENV/?spm_id_from=333.1387.0.0&amp;vd_source=0a8a30e495e3cdaa7291f4e0d60c2599"><span>箭厂《今夜斯卡拉》</span></a></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>BGM</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小沈阳《一天到晚游泳的鱼》（原唱：张雨生）</span></p><span></span><p><span>高秀敏、赵本山二人转小段《墙里墙外》</span></p><span></span><p><span>BRYCE JACOBS (ASCAP) - </span><em><span>1991</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>George Strait - </span><em><span>I Just Want To Dance With You</span></em></p><span></span><h2><span>了解更多</span></h2><span></span><p><span>哔哩哔哩 | 微博 | 抖音 | 视频号 | 小红书</span></p><span></span><p><span>搜索「箭厂视频」或「箭厂」</span></p><span></span><h2><span>节目制作</span></h2><span></span><p><span>策划 编辑 | 嘎嘎</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑 | 球球 嘎嘎</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhGC2EWp92jZrf4H756SWA5kW0IB.m4a" length="100819190" type="audio/mp4"/>
