    <guid isPermaLink="false">629f3d0bd02ea2b34ca887b1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Jun 2022 11:56:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天是上海复工复产恢复往日秩序的第7天，北京恢复堂食的第1天，也是上海某大学生梓楠封校以来留守原地的第91天。本期节目就拉来梓楠和北京某大学生斌仔聊了聊疫情下的校园生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有同学因在图书馆门口聚集打麻将被通报批评；有学校为防止学生酗酒出事下达“禁酒令”；进超市购物前要在app上预约摇号，1万个人里摇500个；早上也总是被宿舍思政老师摇醒做核酸……但总有一些可以苦中作乐的时刻：学校发放的物资里除了粽子还有辣条，学校大草坪也久违地生长出各式各样的活动：野餐、蹦迪、广场舞、套圈儿、飞盘……而终于走出宿舍可以在校园自由走动的那天，梓楠看见，同学们正不约而同地抬头看天，他想：“啊，这就是自由。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>（虽然shownotes写得还算严肃，但这一期笑声极其猖狂，还请大家见谅。）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期来宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FqspH9Iy2OTqtU9yHhMdXK972Az3.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FleS1v-yPIauDIQI1zdMeLcBgk3E.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【制作】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>嘎嘎</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【编辑】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>嘎嘎</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【运营】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>梓楠</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期剧透】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">00:05:30</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>吃了顿午饭，我的书就被封在图书馆电脑被留在办公室</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">00:10:54</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>进超市前买东西要预约摇号，1万个人抢500个购物名额</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1102">00:18:22</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>学生喝大以后，学校下达了“禁酒令”</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">00:20:16</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>封校以后，学校大草坪生长出各种活动，野餐、套圈，还有月老恋爱盒</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">00:23:54</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>在图书馆门口聚集打麻将，学生被处分</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">00:30:00</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>可以在学校自由流动的那天，同学们不约而同地抬头望天</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">00:32:12</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>我们是不是应该更愤怒一些？</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2297">00:38:17</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>趁室友都不在，我要爆料</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2703">00:45:03</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>哎，想回趟家怎么这么难？</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">00:49:40</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>线上活动明明是迫不得已的次优选，却逐渐成为大家习以为常的首选</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3280">00:54:40</a></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>疫情以来，我们很难再和爸妈一起走在学校里，庆祝入学或者毕业了</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">00:56:20</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>疫情过去你最期待做什么？别说出国了，让我出闵行就好</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>7 Little Girls Sitting in The Backseat-Paul Evans</span></p><span></span><p><span>给我点时间-Lil Ghost小鬼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听平台】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Apple Podcast | Spotify | 网易云音乐 | 喜马拉雅 | 小宇宙 &nbsp;| 汽水儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>搜索“箭厂电台”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【欢迎来信】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>talktoarrowfactory@163.com</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FoYtPW6XdWZASHHZqKVI-wVBQ6VF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>努力隔周更新</span></p>]]></description>
