    <title>箭厂电台15 我们需要怎样的县城叙事？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/629327885cf4a5ad60ca0d41</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">629327885cf4a5ad60ca0d41</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 May 2022 07:57:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《县城记》系列纪录片暂时告一段落，我们邀请了该系列的四位导演聊一聊幕后故事、创作思考，以及掏心窝子的话。还没有看过纪录片的朋友，诚邀补番。</span></p><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><p><span>知哲 《县城记》总制片</span></p><p><span>Zoe 《县城记｜肃南》导演、系列总导演</span></p><p><span>桑汉 《县城记｜惠安、寿光》导演</span></p><p><span>王天天 《县城记｜满洲里》导演</span></p><p><strong><span>【制作】</span></strong></p><p><span>友斌 嘎嘎</span></p><p><strong><span>【编辑】</span></strong></p><p><span>嘎嘎</span></p><p><strong><span>【运营】</span></strong></p><p><span>梓楠</span></p><p><strong><span>【本期剧透】</span></strong></p><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">00:05:34</a></span></em></strong></p><p><span>为什么想到拍《县城记》？</span></p><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">00:09:35</a></span></em></strong></p><p><span>“小县城没故事，大县城才有故事”吗？</span></p><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">00:11:39</a></span></em></strong></p><p><span>比起深入个体故事，从集体存在的角度挖掘县城更吸引我</span></p><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1129">00:18:49</a></span></em></strong></p><p><span>日常生活中那些平实、朴素、缓慢的东西，就是迷人的</span></p><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">00:28:42</a></span></em></strong></p><p><span>在肃南我以为拍的是母性的故事，没想到其实是个爱情故事</span></p><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2226">00:37:06</a></span></em></strong></p><p><span>拍了《县城记》还有什么遗憾吗？</span></p><p><strong><span>【本期提及】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MzIzMDU1MDI3OQ==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2350448029712908289&amp;scene=173&amp;from_msgid=2247503365&amp;from_itemidx=1&amp;count=3&amp;nolastread=1&amp;token=667866528&amp;lang=zh_CN#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MzIzMDU1MDI3OQ==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2350448029712908289&amp;scene=173&amp;from_msgid=2247503365&amp;from_itemidx=1&amp;count=3&amp;nolastread=1&amp;token=667866528&amp;lang=zh_CN#wechat_redirect"><span>纪录片《县城记》</span></a></p><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><p><span>阿芬擐人-交工乐队</span></p><p><span>夜已晚-五条人</span></p><p><strong><span>【收听平台】</span></strong></p><p><span>Apple Podcast | Spotify | 网易云音乐 | 喜马拉雅 | 小宇宙 &nbsp;| 汽水儿</span></p><p><span>搜索“箭厂电台”</span></p><p><strong><span>【欢迎来信】</span></strong></p><p><span>talktoarrowfactory@163.com</span></p><p></p><p><span>努力隔周更新</span></p>]]></description>
