    <pubDate>Fri, 01 Apr 2022 04:27:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>白菜8元/斤，菠菜15元/斤，莴笋7.5元/斤，番茄15元/斤，薄皮青椒15元/斤……“封”火连三月，家“蔬”抵万金，抢菜囤菜最近成了上海人民重要的生活主题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天是浦西封控的第一天。嘎嘎周围外卖几乎全部停摆。对处理食物有点经验的Kit为大家介绍了几道粤菜家常菜谱，如果你手上有白菜、鸡蛋、排骨、蒜头，以及电饭锅，还有点时间，不如跟着一起做起来。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YBbYBz4JCWcr-B9q-n0x0g" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YBbYBz4JCWcr-B9q-n0x0g"><span>CATI2 feat. P.J &amp; Keyso寿君超 - 先抢菜，再做核酸</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【剪辑】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>嘎嘎</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【编辑】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>嘎嘎</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【运营】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>梓楠</span></p>]]></description>
